node_modules
dist
.git
*.md
.env
.env.local
# .env.production is NOT excluded here on purpose: it holds a non-secret
# relative URL (VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1), committed to git specifically so
# `vite build` (invoked by frontend/Dockerfile's `npm run build`) can read
# it. A blanket ".env.*" pattern here excluded it from the build context
# entirely, so the build silently fell back to its hardcoded
# http://localhost:8080/api/v1 default — confirmed live 2026-09-13,
# breaking every API call from the deployed frontend (users saw a generic
# "Something went wrong" on register/login, caused by the browser trying to
# reach localhost:8080 on their own machine, not the real backend).
